  "commentary": {
    "market_commentary": "The SSY Pacific Capesize Index rose 1,063 points from last week to 7,493 points. SSY’s assessed Australia-China iron ore spot voyage rate rose $1.25/t from the previous week to $11.15/t. Meanwhile, the Pacific round-voyage rate reached the highest level in over a year, up $7,000/day week-on-week to $26,500/day.",
    "index_notes": "The Pacific Capesize Index started at 5,000 points on 27 December 1995 and has since been subject to periodic updating to reflect changing trade patterns. The latest update was on 17 July 2015.",
